<title>NETHERLANDS: Exxon expands Rotterdam paraxylene plant.</title>
<headline>Exxon expands Rotterdam paraxylene plant.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exxon Chemical said on Tuesday that it planned to expand its Rotterdam-based paraxylene facility by 330,000 tons per year.</p>
<p>The investment will increase the group's paraxylene capacity in Europe to over 500,000 tons per year and bring worldwide capacity to over 1.5 million tons per year, Exxon said in a statement. Start-up is scheduled for the second quarter of 1998.</p>
<p>Exxon said feedstock for the expansion would come from its European refinery network. Exxon Chemical is a division of Exxon Corp.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
